# Cells for runs/2026-10-16-maya.md, stage 3: Maya's side of each round in ../../maya/maya-vs-llamacpp.sh,
# one pass per round (PASSES=1), over ../../maya/maya-glm53f.env, in CT 123 holding both cards. Written
# from stage 2's arms: the one-card arm is 1c-mtp (GPU 2, 0000:83:00.0, the MTP block drafting); no
